  "instructions": [
    "Melt the unsalted butter in a small pan over low heat until foamy.",
    "Add the diced red onion and sauté for 2 minutes until translucent.",
    "Stir in the fresh corn kernels and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Remove the pan from heat and let the mixture cool to room temperature.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooled corn mixture, diced red bell pepper, cucumber, and parsley.",
    "Drizzle olive oil and lemon juice over the salad, then season with salt and pepper.",
    "Gently fold all ingredients together until evenly coated.",
    "Chill the salad in the refrigerator for 30 minutes before serving."
